          "text": "You came into hospital after a seizure at work. It was witnessed by others and lasted about 2 minutes. The team found this was your first seizure. You had some confusion afterwards and a bite to the side of your tongue. No previous seizures were found. No alcohol or drug trigger was identified. There was no head injury."
